BGIDEMO - a tour of the BGI-style graphics library, drawn from native code.

Language features
  - <graphics.h>: initgraph, rectangle/circle, bar/pieslice, fillpoly, arc
  - TrueType text from a seed (loadfont, settextstyle, outtextxy)
  - drawing straight onto the BASIC screen at native speed

Try it
  LOADFONT "PHILO.TTF"
    SEED h%, "BGIDEMO.SED" : CALL h%, 0

Build it on the machine
  grow bgidemo          # -> build/BGIDEMO.SED
  (grow links the berry-libc from SEEDCORE.PKT for this one automatically)
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as BGIDEMO.SED, ready to use.

